Facility Topology is part of Data Center Control Plane (DCCP), Tranche 1:
Canonical Facility State. It is repository 2 of 8 and owns the generation-bound
structural model of the physical facility.

Third-party notices
-------------------

This product includes no third-party source code and links no third-party
libraries. It is implemented against the C++20 standard library and the
operating-system interfaces it needs for durable atomic file replacement and
advisory file locking.

The canonical serialization format, the integrity digest (SHA-256, FIPS 180-4)
and every identity, generation and epoch type are implemented in this
repository.
